<title>ESTONIA: LEKS LEADS CORPORATE INSURANCE MARKET.</title>
<headline>LEKS LEADS CORPORATE INSURANCE MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leks Insurance was Estonia's leader in local corporate insurance with a market share of 17 percent in May, it said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Leks collected 4.46 million kroons in premiums in the corporate insurance market in May, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Polaris-Vara had 12 percent, BICO 11 percent and ASA Insurance 11 percent of the corporate insurance market.</p>
<p>Eesti Kindlustus, a subsidiary of Hoiupank , was the market leader in individual insurance with 40 percent. It collected 4.1 million kroons in premiums in May.</p>
<p>Polaris had 27 percent and Leks 12 percent of the individual insurance market.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
